        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/IndividualClientFunctionality</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> Validates add, edit, and delete flows for a client's crypto/e-wallets detail line.</p>
        <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
        <p><b>Owner:</b> QA Team</p>
        <p><b>Tags:</b> regression, smoke, wallets</p>
        <p><b>Dependencies:</b> navigateToNewestClientMenu</p>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Test Suites">
        <chapter title="Add, Edit, Delete Client Wallets">
        </chapter>
    </chapter>

    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Add Client Wallet" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Client Wallet</p>
            <p>Creates a new wallet record for the client with randomized address and currency selection.</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Faker-generated wallet name and crypto address</p>
            <step>Load client → Navigate to Wallets → Add → Fill name, address, select currency → Save</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Toast/notification confirms the wallet has been added.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
        <procedure title="Edit client Wallet" id="test-2">
